          },
          "mechanism": "Work stress could cause pain and somatic symptoms leading to acetaminophen use and mental health symptoms related to bipolar diagnosis, but could also be a consequence of psychiatric illness.",
          "justification": "Module 1 data timing versus Module 2 exposure is unknown; bipolar diagnosis occurred at unknown past age. Cannot determine whether work stress is a prior confounder predisposing to both exposure and outcome, or a mediator and consequence of mental illness, without temporal anchoring.",
